## Root Cause
`tests/suite/replay_test.go:13` asserts:

```go
if calc.Add(2, 3) != 5 { t.Fatal("Add must sum its arguments") }
```

The production implementation in `services/calc/calc.go` subtracts instead of
adding (`return a - b`), so `calc.Add(2, 3)` returns `-1` and the assertion
fails with `Add must sum its arguments`. This is a planted defect in
PRODUCTION source; the assertion is correct and must stay untouched.

